{
  "description": "@lastChapter is live during playback (after a resume, once playback reaches the next chapter): logic run by a cue, an overlay's button, a key or the timer reads the chapter playback is in (a cue at a chapter's start still reads the chapter it ends, as a disc's cell command does). @lastNumber reads the playing (or last played) media's number. saveResume can save a whole play item, so the resumed title keeps its own end and cues.",
  "level": 3,
  "valid": true,
  "manifest": {
    "format": "openvideomenu",
    "version": "0.1",
    "level": 3,
    "title": {
      "name": "Live State"
    },
